        <mxCell id="notes" value="• Nginx is the sole public entry (/ → Open WebUI, /grafana/ → Grafana, /gateway/ → AI Gateway).&#xa;• Prometheus scrapes Node Exporter, cAdvisor, and AI Gateway on the internal Docker network.&#xa;• MCP investigation uses stdio; tools produce MITRE mapping, SIEM queries, and investigation output.&#xa;• OpenAI provider is optional; default local inference is Ollama." style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=11;fontColor=#475569;fontFamily=Helvetica;spacingLeft=4;" vertex="1" parent="1">
